        "rationale": "The diff touches only .github/workflows/e2e.yml, leaves tests, config and exported runs alone, preserves the `e2e` job name so the required check still reports, and declines the unnecessary browser cache; the only additions are short comments and the slightly opinionated `--only-shell` and `--workers=4` choices."
      },
